# AB-035: The same bicarbonate sample moves in opposite directions under acid and base
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaHCO3 0.001mol
seal v1 100mL
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 NaHCO3 0.001mol
seal v2 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.0005mol
add v2 NaOH 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
inspect
